<title>SINGAPORE: UPP sees 1997 better than 1996.</title>
<headline>UPP sees 1997 better than 1996.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Timber company United Pulp and Paper Ltd (UPP) said on Friday it expected its results in 1997 to be better than those in 1996.  </p>
<p>&quot;Barring unforeseen circumstances, the board is confident that the results of the group for 1997 will improve over those of 1996,&quot; the company said in a statement issued with its 1996 results.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
